      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.stpetersmo.net/663/Old-Town-St-Peters",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1886, the building was sold to Reinhard Kunderer and served as a tavern, dance hall, and rooming house during the railroad era.",
